      "text": "Vonoprazan:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " healing of erosive esophagitis 20 mg once daily for 8 weeks; maintenance 10 mg once daily for up to 6 months; non-erosive GERD heartburn 10 mg once daily for 4 weeks."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
